  "what_moved": "188 pair-golden leaves: 123 rows that did not exist before (the five new support casts, the four rider on-hit blocks, Shen's self_shield_events) and 65 values that moved.  The two leaf-count fingerprints follow them and are already declared by the riders and E receipts this unit merged.  Nothing in either coupled baseline moved (both compare clean); the coupled-exact baseline's single cleaver_bloodsong_roster difference is older than this unit and reproduces at ac712803 with this unit's src/calculator/support_effects.py reverted to that commit.",
  "why": {
    "five_support_casts_join_the_rotation": "Bard W, Jarvan IV W, Rakan E, Soraka R and Shen R are shield/heal-only abilities the ally-support scanner could not price because no cast existed to hang the packet on (census slice 3).  Each is now a zero-damage cast in SLOTS, which adds one `abilities_level_*` row and one 0.0 `breakdown_totals` entry per fight.  Bard's is the only one that moves a number: Caretaker's Shrine is an ability cast, so it procs Spellblade (Trinity Force 137.33 -> 274.67 at level 18, 104.0 -> 208.0 at level 11) — the same reason Soraka W already did.",
    "four_damage_riders": "Milio P (Fired Up!), Seraphine P (Stage Presence), Sona P (Power Chord) and Taric P (Bravado) each carried a cached damage row and priced nothing (census slice 6).  Each now emits an on-hit entry, so its `passive` baseline row stops being the compiler's zero-damage shell — `cooldown 0.0`, `rank 0`, `resource_cost 0.0`, `resource_type MANA` all become absent, and a sourced `on_hit` block and `detail` appear — and its sustained fights gain the rider's damage.  PROOF that the rider is the whole of it: with each module's proc option set to 0 (`p_procs`, `p_notes`, `p_power_chords`, `p_empowered_attacks`), every one of the 32 committed sustained totals for these four champions reproduces exactly.",
    "on_hit_item_rows_that_follow": "In the sustained scenarios the rider changes the target's health walk — Sona's level-18 physical build now ends the target at 0.0 health where the baseline left 82.68 — so Kraken Slayer's on-hit row moves with it (Sona 18: 129.11 -> 131.85).  Same option-at-0 proof.",
    "shen_ki_barrier": "Shen P rides the E cast as a `self_shield_events` payload, so E's `detail` gains the shield sentence and a `self_shield_events` leaf appears.  The shield absorbs incoming damage and changes no outgoing number."
  }
}
